WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.298
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.398 --> 00:01.498
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.498 --> 00:02.538
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.538 --> 00:03.668
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:04.598 --> 00:05.808
Just once.

6
00:06.608 --> 00:07.908
Please help me out just this once.

7
00:07.978 --> 00:10.208
Do you think I would have called you if I were not desperate?

8
00:14.448 --> 00:16.618
Your place is not doing well anyway, right?

9
00:17.078 --> 00:18.788
Can you not just close for today and help out?

10
00:19.188 --> 00:20.548
What about our Mu Jin?

11
00:21.048 --> 00:23.058
He closed his restaurant for a week to help you.

12
00:23.118 --> 00:24.518
You shameless jerk.

13
00:25.388 --> 00:27.688
It is a waste of time to even curse at you. Get lost.

14
00:28.058 --> 00:29.758
(Han Gyu Min)

15
00:37.138 --> 00:38.838
Do you have an extra chef uniform?

16
00:39.338 --> 00:41.238
- Gyu Rim. - Gyu Rim.

17
01:14.568 --> 01:17.738
Hey, I think you are right. I do not think I can do this alone.

18
01:19.248 --> 01:21.418
That is why I am here.

19
01:31.628 --> 01:32.628
Gyu Rim.

20
01:34.058 --> 01:35.528
You know I am a good cook, right?

21
01:36.228 --> 01:37.328
I will help you.

22
01:38.398 --> 01:39.828
Do not worry, Mu Jin.

23
01:43.168 --> 01:45.568
What should I do first? Just tell me what to do.

24
02:29.178 --> 02:30.178
Let me see.

25
02:40.088 --> 02:41.158
Let's do this.

26
02:57.608 --> 02:58.608
Kim Mu Jin.

27
03:00.578 --> 03:01.578
Ho Yoon.

28
03:02.418 --> 03:04.518
- I am not too late, am I? - Oh my.

29
03:05.288 --> 03:06.418
I brought an assistant, too.

30
03:08.018 --> 03:09.088
Thank you.

31
03:09.358 --> 03:11.928
But I think I have seen her a lot in photos.

32
03:12.758 --> 03:14.188
This is my girlfriend, Han Gyu Rim.

33
03:15.028 --> 03:16.128
Thank you.

34
03:18.058 --> 03:20.598
So, what should we do first? Give us some work.

35
03:27.508 --> 03:28.508
Great.

36
03:28.608 --> 03:30.938
You guys look much better than our part-timers.

37
03:32.548 --> 03:33.648
Check yourself again.

38
03:34.308 --> 03:35.418
You check yourself again, too.

39
03:35.778 --> 03:38.948
Now, be kind, be polite,

40
03:39.148 --> 03:40.418
and always smile.

41
03:41.658 --> 03:42.888
Let us not make any mistakes.

42
03:43.488 --> 03:44.788
As long as you do not make any.

43
03:45.758 --> 03:47.458
I never make mistakes.

44
03:49.098 --> 03:52.468
This is an emergency, so stay alert, got it?

45
03:52.868 --> 03:53.868
Okay.

46
03:54.128 --> 03:55.138
Okay.

47
03:55.868 --> 03:57.898
- Good luck. - Good luck.

48
04:04.838 --> 04:06.348
Welcome to Dasolo.

49
04:09.978 --> 04:12.348
Kim Ji Eun? This way please.

50
04:14.418 --> 04:16.358
- Lee Seo Yeon? - Welcome.

51
04:16.418 --> 04:17.588
Welcome. I'll show you to your table.

52
04:17.688 --> 04:18.928
Right this way, please.

53
04:27.428 --> 04:29.968
- I can help you with your order. - What is your best dish here?

54
04:30.138 --> 04:31.438
Would you like a recommendation?

55
04:31.638 --> 04:33.638
Take your time with the menu and order when you are ready.

56
04:33.708 --> 04:36.838
- Two of those, and... - Welcome. May I ask the name...

57
04:36.908 --> 04:38.508
- under the reservation? - Oh Seung Won.

58
05:15.848 --> 05:17.118
Here is the Bordeaux wine you ordered.

59
05:17.178 --> 05:18.648
The more you drink it,

60
05:18.748 --> 05:19.818
the deeper the flavour will be.

61
05:21.418 --> 05:23.018
Here is your food.

62
05:27.158 --> 05:29.528
This dish is made with seasonal vegetables...

63
05:39.468 --> 05:40.638
Are you hurt anywhere?

64
05:43.408 --> 05:45.978
It is okay. I will clean this up, so you go to the customer...

65
05:45.978 --> 05:47.808
who ordered and tell them it will be delayed,

66
05:48.748 --> 05:50.048
then go to the kitchen and put the order in.

67
05:50.748 --> 05:52.188
I will reorder it with the kitchen.

68
05:52.718 --> 05:54.788
I am sorry.

69
05:55.158 --> 05:56.158
I am sorry.

70
05:59.758 --> 06:00.758
It is okay.

71
06:05.728 --> 06:07.628
I am sorry. I am so sorry.

72
06:07.698 --> 06:08.798
Due to my mistake, the food you ordered...

73
06:08.868 --> 06:10.068
will be delayed a little.

74
06:11.298 --> 06:12.438
I am really sorry.

75
06:13.138 --> 06:15.178
I am sorry.

76
07:00.218 --> 07:03.218
(Good Strategy, Bad Strategy)

77
07:31.048 --> 07:33.048
She said she was a deity.

78
07:34.248 --> 07:37.288
Even Shaman Park said in her 38 years of practice,

79
07:37.488 --> 07:40.158
she has never seen such a slick crazy woman.

80
07:42.658 --> 07:46.068
But at least she did not claim to be God or Buddha, right?

81
07:47.068 --> 07:49.298
Because of these darn hands and fingers,

82
07:49.838 --> 07:52.468
what am I doing in my old age?

83
07:53.538 --> 07:55.878
I feel like I have become a criminal accomplice.

84
07:56.578 --> 07:59.748
I cannot even sleep peacefully.

85
08:01.178 --> 08:03.848
If someone has to go to prison, I will go,

86
08:04.078 --> 08:06.388
so you can just relax and sleep peacefully, Mom.

87
08:06.448 --> 08:08.218
Could you sleep peacefully if you were me?

88
08:08.958 --> 08:10.658
Since you have never had a child,

89
08:10.818 --> 08:12.928
how could you possibly understand a mother's heart?

90
08:13.258 --> 08:14.728
Mister, do you have any leftover soju?

91
08:14.888 --> 08:16.498
You do not keep whiskey or anything at home, do you?

92
08:18.498 --> 08:19.928
What did you just say?

93
08:20.628 --> 08:23.638
The way she is talking right now, she is acting like a sly fox.

94
08:23.998 --> 08:26.638
It seems she has come to her senses.

95
08:26.708 --> 08:28.108
No.

96
08:28.438 --> 08:30.178
The doctor said...

97
08:30.238 --> 08:31.238
she would not recover this quickly.

98
08:32.348 --> 08:34.708
Do you recognise him?

99
08:35.108 --> 08:36.778
The one you crushed when you were in your right mind,

100
08:36.848 --> 08:38.248
the one you treated like dog crap,

101
08:38.318 --> 08:40.488
you know this is Jo Heung Sik, right?

102
08:43.418 --> 08:44.958
Why are you calling him that?

103
08:45.058 --> 08:46.758
He is my younger brother, Nam Jeong Bae.

104
08:47.088 --> 08:48.658
Jeong Bae, you eat this.

105
08:52.428 --> 08:53.698
I do not think she is in her right mind, Mom.

106
08:53.768 --> 08:55.268
What should we do?

107
08:56.538 --> 08:58.468
And who is Nam Jeong Bae?

108
09:00.868 --> 09:02.278
I think she is drifting in and out.

109
09:02.338 --> 09:03.408
You rotten punk.

110
09:03.678 --> 09:05.878
Instead of chicken feet, I just want to rip off...

111
09:06.178 --> 09:08.378
these darn hands and throw them to her to eat.

112
09:09.218 --> 09:11.618
Why are you doing this, Mom? Are we filming a horror movie?

113
09:18.018 --> 09:19.788
She is worse than a nine-tailed fox.

114
09:20.258 --> 09:21.898
All of this at once...

115
09:25.528 --> 09:26.898
- Goodbye. - Goodbye. Thank you.

116
09:26.968 --> 09:27.968
- Thank you. - Thank you.

117
09:29.798 --> 09:31.298
Thank you, get home safely.

118
09:38.438 --> 09:39.578
Are you gangsters?

119
09:40.148 --> 09:41.708
I am sorry for making a mistake earlier.

120
09:42.648 --> 09:43.978
I am sorry.

121
09:54.558 --> 09:57.698
I was so scared I thought I was going to go crazy.

122
09:59.368 --> 10:00.628
If it were not for you guys,

123
10:01.398 --> 10:03.768
I might have actually died from a heart attack.

124
10:06.138 --> 10:07.908
Thank you so much.

125
10:13.508 --> 10:15.878
If we are like this, how is the kitchen right now?

126
10:35.228 --> 10:38.138
Thank you, Chef Ho Yoon. With this, I have paid back...

127
10:38.198 --> 10:39.538
one-tenth of what I owe you, right?

128
10:41.068 --> 10:42.308
Hey, eat before you go.

129
11:09.868 --> 11:10.868
Thank you.

130
11:12.338 --> 11:13.608
Great job today.

131
11:14.708 --> 11:15.978
You too, Mu Jin.

132
11:16.838 --> 11:18.848
You really did a great job today.

133
11:27.548 --> 11:31.618
Back off a little. I cannot breathe. I said back off.

134
11:32.658 --> 11:34.688
Han Gyu Seo, what are you doing right now?

135
11:35.128 --> 11:38.558
Let go of me. People are looking at us weirdly.

136
11:39.168 --> 11:40.728
Who is looking at us weirdly?

137
11:40.798 --> 11:42.668
Is it your first time seeing a younger brother hug his brother?

138
11:43.238 --> 11:46.468
Yes, it is my first time. I have seen it a lot in movies,

139
11:46.538 --> 11:48.108
but it is my first time seeing it in real life.

140
11:48.168 --> 11:51.138
What is wrong with him today? Did I do something to him today?

141
11:52.278 --> 11:53.678
I am so glad I have you.

142
11:54.278 --> 11:56.678
Having you in my life is such a huge relief.

143
11:59.488 --> 12:03.058
The plate disaster today? Right.

144
12:03.118 --> 12:04.218
If it were not for you, Gyu Oh,

145
12:04.288 --> 12:05.488
what would Han Gyu Seo have done today?

146
12:05.858 --> 12:09.328
Still, this is too much. Hey, even with my girlfriend,

147
12:09.398 --> 12:11.128
I do not hug her like this, man.

148
12:11.728 --> 12:15.938
Just let him hug you, Gyu Oh. Han Gyu Seo kept saying he wanted to...

149
12:15.998 --> 12:17.938
give you a big hug anyway.

150
12:18.198 --> 12:20.238
Why would he hug me? And a big one at that.

151
12:21.638 --> 12:22.878
Because you've finally come to your senses...

152
12:22.938 --> 12:26.678
and are living a proper life. You quit being a host bar worker...

153
12:28.478 --> 12:29.648
And...

154
12:39.128 --> 12:41.458
You guys only know half the story, do you not?

155
12:48.838 --> 12:49.838
Ta-da.

156
12:51.098 --> 12:52.868
- What is this? - What is it?

157
12:54.438 --> 12:56.008
Half the shares of this store are mine,

158
12:56.078 --> 12:57.578
and it opens next Sunday.

159
12:57.878 --> 13:00.008
- I am a boss now. - Are these not clothes?

160
13:00.078 --> 13:01.078
It looks like a clothing store.

161
13:01.148 --> 13:03.978
A boss this handsome, cool, and young,

162
13:04.248 --> 13:06.518
in your 18 years of life, you've probably never seen one.

163
13:07.788 --> 13:10.118
From now on, your older brother...

164
13:10.488 --> 13:12.388
is going to become so amazing and cool,

165
13:12.888 --> 13:14.258
so you can look forward to it, twins.

166
13:17.698 --> 13:19.668
Thank you, Gyu Oh.

167
13:20.428 --> 13:22.738
Thank you, Gyu Oh.

168
13:24.138 --> 13:25.138
Han Gyu Oh,

169
13:25.738 --> 13:28.008
making your younger siblings worry about you,

170
13:28.908 --> 13:30.508
what kind of life have you been living?

171
13:32.278 --> 13:33.278
It is okay, Gyu Oh.

172
13:34.448 --> 13:35.718
It is all in the past.

173
13:36.648 --> 13:38.048
As long as Gyu Rim does not know, it is fine.

174
13:39.588 --> 13:40.688
That is right, Gyu Oh.

175
13:41.548 --> 13:43.158
As long as Gyu Rim does not find out, it is fine.

176
13:46.588 --> 13:47.858
Yes.

177
13:49.328 --> 13:50.798
As long as she does not find out, it is fine.

178
13:53.098 --> 13:54.468
Congratulations, Gyu Oh.

179
13:54.528 --> 13:57.968
You made a really good decision. Congratulations.

180
14:09.548 --> 14:12.418
I figured out your true identity today.

181
14:14.848 --> 14:15.858
You...

182
14:17.558 --> 14:18.888
You are my guardian angel.

183
14:23.558 --> 14:26.528
You must be tired. Hurry up and go inside.

184
14:26.798 --> 14:28.598
When you get in, do not even wash up,

185
14:28.668 --> 14:31.868
just crash and go straight to sleep. Got it?

186
14:32.868 --> 14:35.308
Even if Gyeol asks you to do something,

187
14:35.438 --> 14:36.778
just tell him you will do it tomorrow,

188
14:36.878 --> 14:37.978
and get some good sleep.

189
14:38.708 --> 14:40.708
I understand. Hurry up and go.

190
14:44.878 --> 14:45.888
I should just go?

191
14:46.918 --> 14:48.048
Well...

192
14:48.858 --> 14:50.218
Are you not going to say goodbye?

193
14:51.088 --> 14:54.728
- I did, just a moment ago. - Not like that.

194
14:57.898 --> 15:00.268
Are you not going to give me a passionate hug or something?

195
15:09.108 --> 15:11.078
Next time, you should do it first. Okay?

196
15:11.338 --> 15:13.708
My shy guardian angel.

197
15:17.918 --> 15:19.118
Go and get some rest.

198
15:19.648 --> 15:20.648
I will go.

199
15:22.088 --> 15:23.088
Goodbye.

200
15:24.758 --> 15:25.828
Bye.

201
15:26.288 --> 15:27.628
Thank you for today.

202
15:32.528 --> 15:33.528
Should I stay a little longer?

203
16:08.098 --> 16:10.068
I heard from the Buddhist follower earlier...

204
16:10.498 --> 16:12.508
that young lady has been here since four in the morning...

205
16:12.868 --> 16:15.068
doing 3,000 bows.

206
16:15.808 --> 16:18.038
Wow. What in the world is she praying for...

207
16:18.108 --> 16:19.708
to do something so intense?

208
16:21.378 --> 16:22.448
Mom,

209
16:22.818 --> 16:24.848
could you do 3,000 bows for me?

210
16:25.378 --> 16:26.588
Oh, please...

211
16:26.748 --> 16:28.418
You should be the one doing 3,000 bows...

212
16:28.488 --> 16:31.188
- for your mother first, you brat. - Gosh...

213
16:45.598 --> 16:48.108
(Wishing For Han Gyu Oh's Business Prosperity And Happiness)

214
17:03.918 --> 17:05.728
(Han Gyu Oh)

215
17:06.488 --> 17:07.528
Han Gyu Oh?

216
17:10.728 --> 17:12.468
How do you know Han Gyu Oh?

217
17:14.868 --> 17:17.898
I was just wondering if it is the Han Gyu Oh I know.

218
17:18.038 --> 17:23.338
Is he in his late twenties, without double eyelids, and handsome?

219
17:24.878 --> 17:25.878
Who are you?

220
17:26.778 --> 17:30.578
Who I am is not important. How do you know Han Gyu Oh?

221
17:31.818 --> 17:33.148
He is my younger brother.

222
17:33.648 --> 17:35.088
What do you mean, your younger brother?

223
17:35.588 --> 17:37.218
A younger brother is a younger brother.

224
17:37.288 --> 17:38.818
What other kind of younger brother is there?

225
17:40.128 --> 17:42.658
How do you know our Gyu Oh, ma'am?

226
17:43.658 --> 17:46.398
I told you, who I am is not important.

227
17:46.868 --> 17:48.368
Where is Han Gyu Oh right now?

228
17:50.198 --> 17:52.508
I do not know which Han Gyu Oh you are looking for,

229
17:52.568 --> 17:54.668
but I do not think our Gyu Oh is someone...

230
17:54.738 --> 17:56.408
a lady like you would be looking for.

231
17:59.148 --> 18:00.648
A lady like me?

232
18:01.408 --> 18:05.478
Do you know who I am? Do you have any idea...

233
18:05.578 --> 18:08.948
- how incredible of a person I am? - Mom, stop it. We are at a temple.

234
18:15.288 --> 18:16.298
What is her deal?

235
18:16.998 --> 18:19.598
She is insulting me right now, is she not?

236
18:21.328 --> 18:22.868
No, just stop it, Mom.

237
18:23.168 --> 18:24.498
Do you want to get scolded by Buddha?

238
18:25.138 --> 18:27.238
Seriously.

239
18:28.268 --> 18:29.738
Merciful Buddha.

240
18:35.178 --> 18:36.178
But Mom...

241
18:37.248 --> 18:38.518
How do you know Han Gyu Oh?

242
18:40.418 --> 18:42.888
He is just a younger cousin.

243
18:45.088 --> 18:47.258
I do not have an uncle named Han Gyu Oh.

244
18:48.358 --> 18:50.428
Do you know all of my distant cousins?

245
18:51.028 --> 18:53.498
Why are you being so nosy, you brat?

246
18:58.638 --> 19:01.468
Suspicious. Something is very...

247
19:02.638 --> 19:03.978
unpleasantly suspicious.

248
19:08.048 --> 19:10.918
- Mom, let us talk for a second. - Enough. Why do you keep asking?

249
19:10.978 --> 19:12.748
I am asking how you know Han Gyu Oh.

250
19:12.848 --> 19:14.748
- Why do I have a bad feeling? - I told you to stop.

251
19:15.118 --> 19:16.458
I have to go shopping now. Stop it.

252
19:16.588 --> 19:17.718
Wait a minute.

253
19:26.828 --> 19:28.128
What should I say when I meet Gyeol?

254
19:30.198 --> 19:32.068
That I am his uncle's girlfriend?

255
19:34.408 --> 19:36.308
He is going to be completely shocked.

256
19:38.738 --> 19:41.908
He even confessed to me at the beginning of the semester...

257
19:42.108 --> 19:43.318
that he wanted to marry someone like me.

258
19:45.778 --> 19:47.248
I should buy him something delicious to eat...

259
19:47.318 --> 19:49.518
and explain things to him one by one so he understands,

260
19:50.158 --> 19:51.858
to minimize the shock.

261
19:53.728 --> 19:54.888
What should I do?

262
19:54.958 --> 19:56.898
I have to greet my future in-laws, too.

263
19:58.358 --> 19:59.428
No.

264
20:00.198 --> 20:01.598
The opening ceremony is not the right time.

265
20:09.908 --> 20:12.038
Is Han Gyu Oh a gigolo by any chance?

266
20:13.948 --> 20:15.948
How would my mom know Han Gyu Oh?

267
20:16.448 --> 20:18.818
If he is a handsome man in his late twenties with monolids,

268
20:19.488 --> 20:20.488
that is Han Gyu Oh, right?

269
20:25.558 --> 20:26.688
Why are you asking me that?

270
20:27.258 --> 20:28.728
Ask your mom yourself.

271
20:35.028 --> 20:36.798
I am sure Han Gyu Oh is a gigolo.

272
20:37.238 --> 20:38.498
I would bet my hand that Han Gyu Oh is a gigolo.

273
20:38.568 --> 20:39.568
I would bet my own hand.

274
20:50.118 --> 20:52.718
But are you okay with having a gigolo boyfriend?

275
20:53.688 --> 20:55.188
You are even a school teacher.

276
20:59.228 --> 21:00.658
Han Gyu Oh is not a gigolo.

277
21:01.028 --> 21:03.158
He is a hardworking man who does his job diligently,

278
21:03.728 --> 21:05.898
and he is definitely not the person your mom knows.

279
21:06.668 --> 21:08.998
If you send me this kind of message one more time...

280
21:09.068 --> 21:11.768
and slander my Gyu Oh, I will go find your mom.

281
21:13.368 --> 21:16.708
How you tried to buy my Gyu Oh by throwing your mom's money around,

282
21:16.878 --> 21:17.978
I will expose it all.

283
21:30.358 --> 21:32.688
Why? Do you want me to fold a paper tile with this?

284
21:33.228 --> 21:34.228
No.

285
21:34.458 --> 21:36.858
Uncle Gyu Oh is opening his clothing store today.

286
21:37.298 --> 21:38.928
They say my oldest uncle is the boss!

287
21:39.498 --> 21:40.498
What?

288
21:41.598 --> 21:43.438
Gyu Oh finally agreed to it.

289
21:45.538 --> 21:46.868
Hooray.

290
21:47.208 --> 21:50.178
My son is a clothing store owner. Hooray.

291
21:50.238 --> 21:52.748
My mom is a side dish store owner, too.

292
21:52.808 --> 21:56.178
That is right, my daughter is a side dish store owner, too.

293
21:56.178 --> 21:57.178
Hooray.

294
21:58.548 --> 22:01.618
Wow, our family is just overflowing with business owners.

295
22:02.488 --> 22:03.788
- Grandpa. - Yes?

296
22:03.958 --> 22:05.488
I am the class vice president, too.

297
22:05.618 --> 22:08.558
That is right, hooray for our vice president Han Gyeol, too.

298
22:09.258 --> 22:13.328
Man, should I ask them to make me the neighbourhood head or something?

299
22:15.798 --> 22:17.498
- But Grandpa. - Yes.

300
22:18.438 --> 22:20.738
I have been watching you for ten days,

301
22:21.168 --> 22:24.738
and you agreed to share this mat with my mom,

302
22:25.008 --> 22:26.778
so why are you using it all by yourself?

303
22:27.548 --> 22:29.518
My mom groans in her sleep, too,

304
22:29.578 --> 22:33.518
- and her whole body aches. - Goodness, a man without a son...

305
22:33.588 --> 22:34.588
cannot even live in peace...

306
22:35.248 --> 22:37.318
No, I do have sons.

307
22:37.858 --> 22:38.918
I have two of them.

308
22:40.528 --> 22:44.498
Hold on a second. Where is our CEO right now?

309
22:47.668 --> 22:49.028
Gyu Seo and I will head out a bit early...

310
22:49.098 --> 22:50.098
and hand out flyers.

311
22:51.838 --> 22:53.138
High schoolers should be studying.

312
22:53.338 --> 22:54.838
- We're not into studying. - We're not into studying.

313
22:56.508 --> 22:57.578
- We have too many other things... - We have too many other things...

314
22:57.578 --> 22:58.578
- on our minds besides studying. - on our minds besides studying.

315
23:02.478 --> 23:04.218
You two really must be soul twins.

316
23:05.918 --> 23:07.918
Anyway, it is your opening day.

317
23:07.988 --> 23:09.488
Should you not at least go to a salon?

318
23:10.188 --> 23:11.688
If I get any more handsome,

319
23:11.788 --> 23:12.958
I will have to debut in entertainment.

320
23:15.888 --> 23:18.298
Our CEO!

321
23:19.698 --> 23:21.498
Hey, but this shirt,

322
23:21.568 --> 23:25.198
it is a brand that is super popular among my friends.

323
23:26.668 --> 23:29.938
This is your staff uniform, right?

324
23:30.508 --> 23:32.008
Give me one too.

325
23:32.078 --> 23:34.578
I will do an amazing job promoting it for you.

326
23:35.108 --> 23:37.578
It is pretty.

327
23:38.648 --> 23:40.748
Gyu Oh...

328
23:41.918 --> 23:43.118
Gyu Oh.

329
23:43.858 --> 23:46.458
Gyu Oh, well, this...

330
23:46.758 --> 23:50.498
Let your father be of some help to you...

331
23:50.558 --> 23:52.228
since our eldest son is starting a new life.

332
23:52.298 --> 23:53.298
Let go.

333
23:54.068 --> 23:55.068
No.

334
23:56.138 --> 23:59.138
- Father. - No. I cannot let go.

335
23:59.508 --> 24:01.438
Until you give your father something to do,

336
24:01.538 --> 24:02.538
I am not letting go.

337
24:03.738 --> 24:07.578
You and I just do not remember,

338
24:07.848 --> 24:11.278
but I might be a better father than you think...

339
24:11.878 --> 24:14.418
No, I might be a decent father.

340
24:14.818 --> 24:16.818
Just ask Gyu Min and Gyu Seo.

341
24:17.288 --> 24:21.188
What is it? No. Not just decent,

342
24:21.458 --> 24:24.428
I might actually be a much more wonderful father.

343
24:24.858 --> 24:27.868
I might be a touching and respectable father...

344
24:28.328 --> 24:30.998
who brings you to tears when you think about it.

345
24:31.138 --> 24:33.868
- I get it. Let go. - Wait, wait.

346
24:34.568 --> 24:35.608
I said let go.

347
24:36.068 --> 24:38.838
Gyu Rim, think about it a bit more.

348
24:38.908 --> 24:41.308
Something your father did well. No, no.

349
24:41.378 --> 24:43.478
Something I did really well for Gyu Oh.

350
24:43.578 --> 24:47.248
- Hurry up and think of something. - My arm hurts. Let go.

351
24:47.388 --> 24:48.488
- No. - Let go.

352
24:48.648 --> 24:50.158
- No. - Let go and talk.

353
24:50.358 --> 24:51.758
- No. - Let me go.

354
24:51.918 --> 24:53.258
- No. - Let go.

355
24:53.328 --> 24:54.388
No, no.

356
24:54.758 --> 24:57.598
The final interviewees will come to the restaurant later.

357
24:57.998 --> 24:59.928
For the customers whose reservations we cancelled...

358
24:59.998 --> 25:01.798
over the past ten days,

359
25:01.868 --> 25:03.038
we agreed to give them a ten percent discount...

360
25:03.098 --> 25:04.198
on their next visit.

361
25:04.568 --> 25:07.868
- Make it 30 percent. - Does money grow on trees?

362
25:08.168 --> 25:11.408
We have already suffered huge losses from not being able to do business.

363
25:11.508 --> 25:14.648
I said 30 percent. What good is 10 percent?

364
25:17.348 --> 25:19.818
Even if you have to deduct it from my salary, make it 30 percent.

365
25:21.348 --> 25:22.688
Not sending you to the National Assembly...

366
25:22.748 --> 25:24.058
is my greatest regret.

367
25:31.398 --> 25:32.398
What...

368
25:32.798 --> 25:33.798
What is this?

369
25:36.128 --> 25:37.768
Why? What is it?

370
25:38.238 --> 25:40.738
It is a video online, but the thumbnail...

371
25:41.638 --> 25:42.808
What is this?

372
25:44.078 --> 25:47.308
"Exposing Chef Kim Mu Jin of Restaurant Dasolo"?

373
25:47.908 --> 25:48.908
What?

374
25:52.678 --> 25:55.518
Chef Kim Mu Jin might not be on TV.

375
25:55.588 --> 25:57.158
But is he not well-known in the industry?

376
25:58.358 --> 25:59.358
That is right.

377
25:59.928 --> 26:01.688
People say he is about to get a Michelin star,

378
26:02.328 --> 26:03.828
which made my conscience weigh even heavier.

379
26:04.158 --> 26:06.398
I felt I had to confess the truth before it was too late,

380
26:06.468 --> 26:07.728
which is why I decided to come forward.

381
26:08.028 --> 26:12.398
If what you are reporting is true, this is quite shocking.

382
26:12.638 --> 26:15.038
You are saying that in the kitchen of a hotel-grade restaurant,

383
26:15.438 --> 26:16.808
they were recycling food.

384
26:17.738 --> 26:18.738
Yes.

385
26:19.178 --> 26:21.478
I saw them take the leftovers from customers...

386
26:21.548 --> 26:22.548
and prepare them again...

387
26:22.608 --> 26:24.818
to use in other dishes on multiple occasions.

388
26:25.418 --> 26:27.118
The customers cannot tell the difference...

389
26:27.248 --> 26:29.518
- once the sauce is changed. - And the origin of the ingredients.

390
26:30.718 --> 26:32.988
This is Yong Cheol, right?

391
26:33.288 --> 26:35.488
They can blur his face and alter his voice all they want,

392
26:35.688 --> 26:38.528
but that is definitely Yong Cheol. Is this guy out of his mind?

393
26:40.098 --> 26:41.928
What does he mean, we recycle food?

394
26:41.998 --> 26:43.298
Do they not know who Kim Mu Jin is?

395
26:45.668 --> 26:47.768
You said they also falsified the origin of the ingredients.

396
26:47.968 --> 26:49.268
Passing off Chilean products as domestic...

397
26:49.678 --> 26:50.978
and Chinese products as Italian.

398
26:51.438 --> 26:54.278
How can such a famous and expensive restaurant...

399
26:54.448 --> 26:56.918
play around with the food that they serve to people?

400
26:58.918 --> 27:01.048
I was also deeply tormented and struggled with it.

401
27:01.888 --> 27:05.318
But since I had no power on my own, I was in no position to protest.

402
27:06.018 --> 27:07.188
So the employees gathered together...

403
27:07.258 --> 27:08.858
and discussed whether we should expose this...

404
27:09.288 --> 27:10.698
because if we kept turning a blind eye,

405
27:10.758 --> 27:13.068
- we would become accomplices too. - Turn it off.

406
27:13.128 --> 27:14.368
We also worried about what would happen...

407
27:14.428 --> 27:15.428
I need to see what kind of lies...

408
27:15.498 --> 27:17.498
- If a customer actually got sick... - he keeps spouting.

409
27:18.038 --> 27:19.398
Those were the things we talked about.

410
27:30.378 --> 27:33.188
How should I kill this crazy lunatic?

411
27:35.418 --> 27:36.618
Now that I think about it,

412
27:36.818 --> 27:38.188
Yong Cheol must have taken all the guys with him.

413
27:38.258 --> 27:39.788
Everyone except your guy, Gyu Min.

414
27:42.028 --> 27:43.028
What is it?

415
27:43.528 --> 27:45.498
Why on earth is he doing this to you?

416
27:46.368 --> 27:48.628
Did you hit Yong Cheol behind my back?

417
27:51.838 --> 27:53.638
Did his girlfriend fall for you?

418
27:53.708 --> 27:56.478
Did you kill his parents or something?

419
27:57.178 --> 27:59.708
Did our competitor buy him off? Does he gamble?

420
28:00.378 --> 28:02.648
Seriously, what could have made him turn on us like this?

421
28:03.248 --> 28:04.278
What could it be?

422
28:05.548 --> 28:06.548
Who is behind this?

423
28:08.888 --> 28:09.888
What is going on?

424
28:12.658 --> 28:15.488
Seo Yong Cheol's mother is currently hospitalised,

425
28:15.558 --> 28:16.958
and her medical bills up to this point...

426
28:17.058 --> 28:18.128
have all been paid in full.

427
28:18.698 --> 28:20.828
They also said future expenses will be paid...

428
28:20.968 --> 28:22.028
from the Chairman's personal account.

429
28:24.338 --> 28:25.538
I understand. You may leave.

430
28:36.848 --> 28:38.318
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

431
28:38.478 --> 28:39.748
Yes, Chairman Hong.

432
28:40.848 --> 28:42.648
Secretary Kim, do we have any liquor?

433
28:43.488 --> 28:44.688
A double shot of whiskey, neat.

434
28:44.758 --> 28:47.288
- Bring me a glass. - Yes, understood.

435
28:56.868 --> 28:59.468
Jeong Bae, Nam Jeong Bae. Give me some milk.

436
28:59.908 --> 29:01.308
She is not here.

437
29:02.438 --> 29:03.438
Do you have any beer?

438
29:03.938 --> 29:08.478
I think I am going to go crazy. Seriously.

439
29:08.608 --> 29:10.078
How did I end up like this?

440
29:10.378 --> 29:11.648
Did the great Han Gyu Young hide away...

441
29:11.718 --> 29:13.448
and stay cooped up in a room...

442
29:13.548 --> 29:14.788
after studying so hard to become a doctor...

443
29:14.848 --> 29:17.658
- and even studying abroad? - Justice will prevail.

444
29:17.718 --> 29:19.118
What goes around comes around.

445
29:20.788 --> 29:22.158
Stop glaring at me.

446
29:22.228 --> 29:24.558
It only hurts your eyes. It does not hurt me at all.

447
29:25.328 --> 29:26.968
Darn it...

448
29:29.428 --> 29:31.898
Where are you going? Can you take me with you?

449
29:32.198 --> 29:33.938
I have been cooped up in this room so long,

450
29:34.008 --> 29:36.338
I feel like I am going to turn into a madwoman.

451
29:36.338 --> 29:38.308
Even if it is not a luxury boutique,

452
29:38.378 --> 29:40.378
can you not just take me out for some fresh air?

453
29:43.078 --> 29:44.578
All right, let us go together then.

454
29:45.348 --> 29:47.888
Today is the day of Gyu Oh's opening ceremony.

455
29:48.348 --> 29:49.348
What?

456
29:49.588 --> 29:51.018
What opening ceremony is Gyu Oh having?

457
29:52.018 --> 29:53.018
Look at this.

458
29:54.858 --> 29:56.328
Gyu Oh is a boss now.

459
29:56.858 --> 29:59.228
I heard his friend gave him half the shares.

460
29:59.658 --> 30:00.668
Wait.

461
30:01.028 --> 30:03.568
Why would his friend give him half the shares?

462
30:05.938 --> 30:07.268
Did Gyu Oh threaten him?

463
30:07.438 --> 30:10.608
- Did Gyu Oh beat him up for them? - Some sister you are.

464
30:10.938 --> 30:13.608
Do you not know how great of a person your brother is?

465
30:13.908 --> 30:15.778
In this day and age?

466
30:15.948 --> 30:17.518
People do not even give shares to their own family,

467
30:17.578 --> 30:18.978
so why would a friend give them away?

468
30:19.048 --> 30:22.418
I told you earlier, did I not? Justice will prevail.

469
30:22.988 --> 30:26.488
He owed Gyu Oh a favour, so he gave them to him to repay it.

470
30:26.588 --> 30:28.458
- Are you done? - Darn it.

471
30:29.228 --> 30:31.528
He treats me, his own sister, like garbage,

472
30:31.528 --> 30:33.328
but to a friend who does not share a single drop of blood with him,

473
30:33.398 --> 30:35.068
what kind of amazing thing did he do?

474
30:35.128 --> 30:37.498
Is that really something to be angry about right now?

475
30:37.668 --> 30:38.898
I am furious.

476
30:39.438 --> 30:41.268
Why do I feel so wronged and angry?

477
30:44.108 --> 30:46.748
- Is this it? - Boss, today in Paju,

478
30:46.808 --> 30:47.808
the photoshoot.

479
30:47.878 --> 30:49.948
- You did not forget, right? - I forgot.

480
30:51.448 --> 30:52.648
All right, I got it.

481
30:53.848 --> 30:54.848
I will head there right now.

482
30:55.418 --> 30:56.418
Okay.

483
31:02.388 --> 31:03.398
Grandma.

484
31:05.598 --> 31:06.768
Right...

485
31:07.128 --> 31:09.028
You are my karma, are you not?

486
31:09.268 --> 31:12.398
Committed knowingly or unknowingly in this life and past lives,

487
31:12.498 --> 31:13.968
you are my karma.

488
31:14.408 --> 31:16.778
Are you going to Gyu Oh's opening party too, Mother?

489
31:16.908 --> 31:18.638
I do not think I can go because I have plans.

490
31:18.708 --> 31:20.548
How could I go there?

491
31:20.678 --> 31:23.108
Their whole family will be gathered there.

492
31:23.618 --> 31:26.548
I feel like a sinner. How could I even face them?

493
31:26.648 --> 31:27.848
My conscience is so guilty,

494
31:28.118 --> 31:30.918
- how could I even stand there? - Yes, please do not go.

495
31:32.188 --> 31:35.188
Since this crazy girl is telling me not to go,

496
31:35.488 --> 31:37.728
it makes me wonder if I should go.

497
31:39.868 --> 31:41.598
Please, do not say anything.

498
31:41.668 --> 31:43.768
- You have to zip it. - I will kick you.

499
31:43.838 --> 31:45.638
- I said zip it. - I said be quiet.

500
31:46.608 --> 31:48.668
- Here, here. - What is it?

501
31:48.738 --> 31:49.768
Now, look here.

502
31:50.908 --> 31:54.308
Put this on, and from here to there,

503
31:54.378 --> 31:56.478
walk around the corner three times, okay?

504
31:56.918 --> 31:59.218
No, what is it? What are you going to do?

505
31:59.318 --> 32:02.118
Well, the woman at the rice cake shop said so.

506
32:02.188 --> 32:04.658
She said when your memory is fuzzy,

507
32:04.718 --> 32:07.058
if you put this rice cooker lid on your head...

508
32:07.128 --> 32:09.728
and walk around the corner of the room three times,

509
32:10.758 --> 32:15.128
just like this lid tightly packs the rice together,

510
32:15.268 --> 32:17.098
your scattered mind...

511
32:17.168 --> 32:20.808
- will come right back together. - Oh, come on.

512
32:20.868 --> 32:22.108
Do not believe in things like that.

513
32:22.168 --> 32:24.138
It is a superstition, a superstition.

514
32:24.608 --> 32:26.478
I do not like the lid. I am scared of the lid.

515
32:27.048 --> 32:30.578
You are scared of the lid? Then,

516
32:30.648 --> 32:34.448
mix dog poop with soybean paste and rub it under your nose. What?

517
32:34.818 --> 32:37.058
Your wandering mind...

518
32:37.118 --> 32:39.318
will be so shocked by the smell of the dog poop...

519
32:39.388 --> 32:41.428
that it will return to its owner.

520
32:41.958 --> 32:46.558
Should I ask Bori next door to lend us some of his poop?

521
32:46.728 --> 32:47.728
What should we do?

522
32:47.968 --> 32:50.568
If you do not want the dog poop either,

523
32:50.638 --> 32:52.298
something even weirder might come.

524
32:53.268 --> 32:54.868
Let us just go with the lid.

525
32:56.678 --> 32:58.678
Right, the lid is better.

526
32:58.778 --> 33:01.248
Now, walk around three times from here.

527
33:01.308 --> 33:04.248
Let us give it a try. Okay? Let us try anything.

528
33:04.618 --> 33:08.018
- Okay... - Good girl. Good girl.

529
33:08.088 --> 33:09.088
Our Gyu Young is a good girl.

530
33:09.148 --> 33:11.418
That is right. Oh, you are doing great. Yes.

531
33:11.688 --> 33:14.088
That is right, that is right. Good job.

532
33:14.158 --> 33:17.758
Our Gyu Young is doing great. Good job.

533
33:18.558 --> 33:21.268
You come into the office on Sundays too?

534
33:22.128 --> 33:24.868
But do you not even offer a cup of tea here?

535
33:29.268 --> 33:30.278
Let us...

536
33:34.108 --> 33:35.808
settle everything with this.

537
33:49.028 --> 33:50.028
Five million dollars...

538
33:50.098 --> 33:52.328
Five million dollars, it is five million dollars, honey.

539
33:52.598 --> 33:54.398
Now, listen.

540
33:56.498 --> 33:58.298
As soon as the courthouse opens tomorrow morning,

541
33:58.368 --> 34:00.238
Han Gyu Young and your son...

542
34:00.308 --> 34:01.438
will immediately file for divorce,

543
34:02.138 --> 34:03.238
and for the rest of your lives,

544
34:03.308 --> 34:05.538
you are not to lay a single finger on Gyu Young.

545
34:06.278 --> 34:08.078
And regarding me and my family,

546
34:08.408 --> 34:11.848
if you agree not to raise any objections whatsoever,

547
34:13.418 --> 34:15.048
that money will be paid immediately.

548
34:15.318 --> 34:16.888
Of course.

549
34:17.488 --> 34:18.518
With this,

550
34:18.618 --> 34:20.888
we are strangers to Gyu Young. No.

551
34:21.658 --> 34:25.358
We'll be completely unaware of each other's existence.

552
34:26.058 --> 34:29.298
The Chairman's faults, Gyu Young's faults, our faults,

553
34:29.368 --> 34:31.768
- we'll cover them all up... - No.

554
34:33.368 --> 34:34.568
We...

555
34:34.768 --> 34:36.908
have completely misjudged you, Chairman Jang.

556
34:38.078 --> 34:39.678
What are you talking about?

557
34:39.838 --> 34:42.408
We underestimated you way too much.

558
34:44.418 --> 34:46.678
- I apologize. - Has this man lost his mind?

559
34:46.888 --> 34:48.188
Why would you give that back?

560
34:54.558 --> 34:56.258
To think you'd hand over five million dollars...

561
34:56.328 --> 34:57.328
like it is pocket money for snacks...

562
34:57.398 --> 34:58.858
We failed to recognise your true greatness, Chairman.

563
35:01.198 --> 35:03.068
We asked for far too little.

564
35:03.838 --> 35:05.438
Just make it a clean ten million dollars.

565
35:06.068 --> 35:07.068
Then, just as you said,

566
35:07.138 --> 35:09.468
we won't raise any objections whatsoever,

567
35:10.378 --> 35:12.478
and we will step away cleanly.

568
35:12.738 --> 35:16.478
He's right. We viewed such a great chairman...

569
35:16.548 --> 35:20.888
far too modestly. Our Chairman Jang's pride...

570
35:20.948 --> 35:22.488
must be hurt.

571
35:23.348 --> 35:26.988
Once you have the money ready, please call us anytime.

572
35:31.828 --> 35:32.898
For all 24 hours of each day...

573
35:34.568 --> 35:36.128
we'll stay awake and be on standby.

574
35:36.998 --> 35:39.538
You parasitic scumbags.

575
35:42.138 --> 35:44.638
As parents, you shouldn't do this.

576
35:44.638 --> 35:46.408
You absolute pieces of trash.

577
35:53.948 --> 35:54.948
I apologize.

578
35:55.018 --> 35:57.418
My true feelings just slipped out. Yes.

579
35:58.858 --> 35:59.858
Alright.

580
36:00.828 --> 36:02.288
Well, if you're going to refuse,

581
36:03.698 --> 36:05.028
let's just pretend this never happened.

582
36:06.028 --> 36:07.228
Instead,

583
36:07.828 --> 36:10.738
you won't be getting a single penny...

584
36:10.868 --> 36:12.898
out of my pocket from now on.

585
36:14.168 --> 36:16.508
Chairman Jang...

586
36:17.608 --> 36:19.808
Let us take this to the end. Yes.

587
36:20.948 --> 36:21.978
Goodbye.

588
36:23.518 --> 36:24.818
And be careful on your way home in the dark.

589
36:27.218 --> 36:28.618
What do we do now.

590
36:31.458 --> 36:33.358
Our guests are leaving.

591
36:37.428 --> 36:39.258
Do we really just leave like this?

592
36:39.698 --> 36:41.028
- Hello. - Hello. It's right next door.

593
36:41.098 --> 36:42.398
We just opened a clothing store right next door.

594
36:42.468 --> 36:43.568
- Okay. - Please stop by.

595
36:43.638 --> 36:45.438
Thank you. We just opened a clothing store right...

596
36:48.408 --> 36:49.708
Just take a look around.

597
36:50.938 --> 36:54.348
(Grand Open All For You)

598
36:55.008 --> 36:57.448
Hello. Nice to meet you.

599
36:57.618 --> 37:00.518
My son opened his business today.

600
37:01.248 --> 37:03.588
There are really nice and pretty clothes inside,

601
37:03.658 --> 37:04.718
so please come in and take a look.

602
37:04.788 --> 37:06.358
- Okay. - Oh, right.

603
37:06.688 --> 37:07.958
Come in, please.

604
37:09.888 --> 37:10.898
Hello. Welcome.

605
37:10.958 --> 37:12.458
Are you looking for anything in particular?

606
37:13.258 --> 37:14.268
Inside...

607
37:15.128 --> 37:17.338
- Welcome. Thank you. - Welcome. Thank you.

608
37:17.398 --> 37:19.338
- Please feel free to look around. - Please feel free to look around.

609
37:21.168 --> 37:22.868
- Welcome. - Welcome.

610
37:23.538 --> 37:24.708
Please feel free to look around.

611
37:28.478 --> 37:29.478
Gyu Oh.

612
37:34.288 --> 37:35.718
Congratulations, Gyu Oh.

613
37:37.088 --> 37:38.418
Thank you, Gyu Rim.

614
37:42.588 --> 37:44.858
I cannot believe my Gyu Oh is a business owner.

615
37:45.998 --> 37:48.328
I can die happy now.

616
37:55.908 --> 37:56.908
You are...

617
37:56.978 --> 37:58.408
the owner of a side dish store, right?

618
38:00.108 --> 38:02.748
I can die happy now.

619
38:04.778 --> 38:07.388
You just need to live a good life now, Father.

620
38:08.488 --> 38:10.288
I will soon be a community leader...

621
38:10.358 --> 38:12.458
No, maybe even faster than that,

622
38:12.518 --> 38:14.888
I could become the owner of that sushi restaurant. Yes.

623
38:15.328 --> 38:17.958
Wow, then how many business owners do we have in our family?

624
38:19.258 --> 38:21.468
I thought you said she was not the one.

625
38:23.268 --> 38:25.498
You can never be sure...

626
38:25.568 --> 38:27.368
about things between a man and a woman.

627
38:28.038 --> 38:29.838
If you try to hold on, they run away,

628
38:29.908 --> 38:31.508
and if you try to let go, they hold on...

629
38:31.578 --> 38:33.678
- Excuse me. - Yes.

630
38:37.378 --> 38:38.448
Ms. Hong...

631
38:39.578 --> 38:41.148
Should I ask Gyu Rim to meet her and see what she thinks?

632
38:43.588 --> 38:44.918
The four of us with Mu Jin...

633
38:45.758 --> 38:48.058
Should we try to have a natural gathering?

634
38:55.628 --> 38:56.628
Gyu Rim.

635
39:02.208 --> 39:03.208
Gyu Rim.

636
39:06.338 --> 39:07.578
We need to talk for a second.

637
39:10.648 --> 39:12.018
- Su Chan. - Yes.

638
39:12.078 --> 39:13.178
Please take care of the customers.

639
39:13.248 --> 39:15.148
- Yes, understood. - I am sorry.

640
39:15.218 --> 39:16.488
I am sorry. Let's go.

641
39:17.088 --> 39:18.088
The size...

642
39:27.328 --> 39:28.498
Why, what is wrong?

643
39:30.798 --> 39:32.168
Brace yourself and look at this.

644
39:42.348 --> 39:44.848
Allegations have been raised that a famous restaurant...

645
39:44.918 --> 39:47.218
has been deceiving customers by recycling food,

646
39:47.288 --> 39:49.288
poorly managing ingredients, and violating origin labelling,

647
39:49.348 --> 39:51.588
which is causing public outrage.

648
39:51.688 --> 39:54.588
- The restaurant in question... - This is Mu Jin's restaurant.

649
39:54.658 --> 39:55.988
is strongly denying the claims, but...

650
39:56.058 --> 39:57.098
Does Mu Jin know?

651
39:57.428 --> 39:59.558
He probably does, the internet is going crazy right now.

652
39:59.628 --> 40:01.228
We will launch a full investigation,

653
40:01.298 --> 40:02.568
and if any illegal activities are confirmed,

654
40:02.628 --> 40:04.168
we will take strict action.

655
40:06.468 --> 40:10.208
Does that even make sense? You ate at our restaurant...

656
40:10.268 --> 40:11.408
and got a stomachache three days later,

657
40:11.478 --> 40:12.978
and you want us to take responsibility for that...

658
40:14.708 --> 40:16.778
You held it in the whole time even though you were sick?

659
40:16.848 --> 40:20.148
For three days. Who do you think you are fooling?

660
40:23.318 --> 40:25.588
You are going to sue us if we do not give you money?

661
40:26.218 --> 40:27.828
You want 1,000 dollars for a settlement?

662
40:30.428 --> 40:31.428
Sue us.

663
40:32.158 --> 40:33.158
Listen...

664
40:34.428 --> 40:36.068
We do not use ingredients that are so bad...

665
40:36.128 --> 40:38.138
that they would give you a stomachache three days later.

666
40:38.498 --> 40:39.968
We have never sold food like that.

667
40:40.538 --> 40:42.308
We want to prove our innocence as well,

668
40:42.538 --> 40:44.238
so please go ahead and sue us, okay?

669
40:50.778 --> 40:52.348
This is driving me crazy.

670
40:53.018 --> 40:55.548
They licked their plates clean and said it was delicious...

671
40:55.618 --> 40:57.888
and did not say a word for ten days.

672
40:58.588 --> 41:00.018
But the moment one fake news story breaks,

673
41:00.158 --> 41:01.388
they swarm us like bees.

674
41:02.358 --> 41:05.028
What is wrong with people, seriously?

675
41:06.258 --> 41:07.768
You know Yong Cheol's new address, right?

676
41:17.838 --> 41:19.908
I got it, I will not be late, so do not worry.

677
41:20.478 --> 41:22.208
I just left the house to head there anyway.

678
41:37.728 --> 41:38.728
Boss...

679
41:43.698 --> 41:44.698
You punk.

680
41:45.768 --> 41:47.738
Boss, that hurts, it hurts. Let go.

681
41:48.468 --> 41:50.008
Use your words. It really hurts.

682
41:50.068 --> 41:52.438
- Use your words, please. - Seo Yong Cheol.

683
41:59.148 --> 42:00.148
We need to talk.

684
42:07.128 --> 42:08.128
Why did you do it?

685
42:11.428 --> 42:13.098
Did I do something wrong to you?

686
42:16.198 --> 42:17.438
Did I upset you in some way?

687
42:17.698 --> 42:19.638
What could you have possibly done wrong to him?

688
42:20.198 --> 42:21.208
When he had no money,

689
42:21.268 --> 42:23.068
you lent him cash and told him to pay you back whenever,

690
42:23.138 --> 42:25.178
you paid for his classes, bought him clothes, shoes,

691
42:25.238 --> 42:26.438
and even sent him rice and meat.

692
42:26.508 --> 42:28.478
That is exactly why. Why treat me like a beggar?

693
42:29.908 --> 42:30.918
Am I a beggar?

694
42:31.318 --> 42:33.678
Giving me money, buying me clothes, buying me shoes, and buying me rice?

695
42:34.218 --> 42:36.418
What kind of crazy nonsense are you spouting, you punk.

696
42:36.788 --> 42:38.058
Just because you have some money,

697
42:38.118 --> 42:40.258
you threw it around at people who have nothing like me.

698
42:41.728 --> 42:43.998
Just like rich people in charities helping out pitiful refugees.

699
42:44.898 --> 42:48.098
You are truly unbelievable.

700
42:48.228 --> 42:50.468
I see now that you are not even worth associating with.

701
42:52.298 --> 42:53.638
Since when does Mu Jin have a lot of money?

702
42:54.068 --> 42:55.768
He barely gets by on his salary too.

703
42:55.838 --> 42:56.908
Save it.

704
42:58.308 --> 42:59.438
Everyone who needs to know...

705
42:59.538 --> 43:00.878
knows that he is the heir to Dongyoon Group.

706
43:02.248 --> 43:04.078
He is disgustingly hiding his true identity...

707
43:04.778 --> 43:06.418
and playing dress-up as a commoner right now.

708
43:08.448 --> 43:10.218
I have never seen anything like this in my life.

709
43:10.918 --> 43:13.158
I know people bite the hand that feeds them, but...

710
43:13.358 --> 43:14.828
what kind of person are you, really?

711
43:16.388 --> 43:17.898
People overflowing with money...

712
43:18.128 --> 43:20.328
They toss it to people like us like they are feeding birds,

713
43:20.398 --> 43:23.168
just to comfort themselves and feel some kind of catharsis, right?

714
43:24.138 --> 43:25.698
Then honestly, is it not just give and take?

715
43:26.468 --> 43:27.838
Chef Kim gave me money,

716
43:28.108 --> 43:30.778
- and I gave him catharsis. - Kim Mu Jin,

717
43:30.838 --> 43:33.778
take a water glass and smash this punk's head in.

718
43:33.838 --> 43:35.878
Settlement money? I will pay for it.

719
43:37.978 --> 43:38.978
Yes.

720
43:39.818 --> 43:40.818
Hit me if you want to.

721
43:50.188 --> 43:53.698
There must be a reason why you turned into such a lunatic.

722
43:54.828 --> 43:56.198
I believe that nothing in this world...

723
43:56.868 --> 43:58.598
happens without a reason.

724
43:59.138 --> 44:00.138
But...

725
44:02.338 --> 44:03.768
I do not want to hear that reason.

726
44:05.478 --> 44:07.008
I do not want to hear your voice...

727
44:07.908 --> 44:09.208
or even your breathing anymore.

728
44:12.348 --> 44:13.348
All right.

729
44:14.418 --> 44:15.418
We are done here.

730
44:17.588 --> 44:18.588
This is the end.

731
44:25.858 --> 44:28.768
Hey, are you just going to leave like that?

732
44:29.568 --> 44:32.298
Are you not going to sue this jerk for defamation and false accusation?

733
44:34.608 --> 44:36.638
Seon. Come here, come here.

734
44:44.748 --> 44:47.018
Here. What do you want to eat?

735
44:47.918 --> 44:50.548
Order everything on the menu. It is my treat today.

736
44:52.288 --> 44:54.358
You look really happy today.

737
44:55.888 --> 44:58.958
My eldest son became the owner of a clothing store.

738
45:02.228 --> 45:03.398
But you look...

739
45:04.068 --> 45:05.138
upset today.

740
45:07.568 --> 45:10.608
I do not care about anything else. I just want to have a drink.

741
45:11.238 --> 45:12.738
Why, did something happen?

742
45:14.078 --> 45:15.178
I do not even want to talk about it.

743
45:17.008 --> 45:18.548
If you do not want to speak, do you want to squeak?

744
45:18.778 --> 45:21.048
I do not know if there are any mice around here.

745
45:28.128 --> 45:29.128
You know what?

746
45:30.158 --> 45:31.558
You are the only one...

747
45:32.328 --> 45:34.628
who laughs at my dad jokes.

748
45:35.628 --> 45:36.728
That is why you are...

749
45:37.068 --> 45:39.638
such a precious and valuable person to me, Seon.

750
45:43.108 --> 45:44.238
You...

751
45:45.608 --> 45:47.278
If you knew what kind of person I am,

752
45:48.878 --> 45:50.378
you would be shocked out of your mind.

753
45:51.848 --> 45:54.988
If you knew what kind of person I am,

754
45:55.718 --> 45:57.388
you would be shocked out of your mind too.

755
45:58.688 --> 46:00.218
Lately, from my eldest daughter,

756
46:00.288 --> 46:02.688
all the good deeds I had forgotten about...

757
46:02.758 --> 46:04.198
are coming to light one by one,

758
46:05.198 --> 46:06.658
and I am completely touched...

759
46:06.828 --> 46:07.898
by my own actions these days.

760
46:16.968 --> 46:17.978
I...

761
46:23.178 --> 46:24.178
I am...

762
46:27.948 --> 46:29.018
disgusted with myself.

763
46:31.958 --> 46:33.318
Wait, why?

764
46:39.028 --> 46:41.068
To ruin my son,

765
46:42.228 --> 46:44.298
to make him a penniless beggar,

766
46:46.768 --> 46:49.268
do you have any idea what I am doing behind his back right now?

767
46:49.908 --> 46:50.908
No...

768
46:51.538 --> 46:53.408
Why would you ruin your son?

769
46:53.478 --> 46:56.278
Why would you make him a beggar?

770
46:59.078 --> 47:01.618
Even if my son has nothing, will that girl...

771
47:04.488 --> 47:06.018
stay by his side?

772
47:07.388 --> 47:08.488
It is a kind of test.

773
47:11.828 --> 47:13.828
Is your son a big shot?

774
47:14.528 --> 47:15.528
Does he have that much money?

775
47:16.128 --> 47:17.128
No.

776
47:18.138 --> 47:19.738
I am not leaving him a single penny.

777
47:21.008 --> 47:22.938
Wait, I thought you were leaving him the sushi restaurant?

778
47:24.738 --> 47:26.038
I am not going to.

779
47:26.978 --> 47:29.578
I thought he was your only son?

780
47:30.248 --> 47:34.118
Do not do that. Just, you know?

781
47:34.188 --> 47:35.848
Leave the sea squirts, sea cucumbers, and octopus...

782
47:36.088 --> 47:38.788
to your son, and leave...

783
47:39.088 --> 47:41.258
the flounder and halibut to your daughter.

784
47:41.328 --> 47:42.858
Divide it up nicely.

785
47:43.128 --> 47:45.498
Excuse me, we will have one bottle of soju here.

786
47:45.628 --> 47:46.628
Yes.

787
47:48.768 --> 47:49.768
Wow.

788
47:50.098 --> 47:52.868
The sushi restaurant world is scary, too.

789
47:54.338 --> 47:55.408
If a sushi restaurant is like this,

790
47:55.738 --> 47:58.178
wow, the conglomerates must be no joke.

791
48:00.178 --> 48:05.048
Then again, I heard mothers and sons sue each other over money.

792
48:06.218 --> 48:07.218
Wow.

793
48:08.148 --> 48:10.648
It is better not to have money.

794
48:10.648 --> 48:11.688
Right?

795
48:17.458 --> 48:19.598
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

796
48:20.058 --> 48:21.598
These are rice cakes for the opening.

797
48:21.798 --> 48:22.798
Today, my older brother...

798
48:22.868 --> 48:24.268
became the owner of a clothing store.

799
48:24.868 --> 48:27.438
Oh my, congratulations.

800
48:29.368 --> 48:33.278
Wait, how old is your brother that he is already an owner?

801
48:33.908 --> 48:34.908
He is 28.

802
48:35.208 --> 48:38.618
Oh my. How impressive.

803
48:40.618 --> 48:44.558
- Your family must be so proud. - Yes.

804
48:44.658 --> 48:47.318
He is my brother, but he is really cool.

805
48:48.588 --> 48:50.658
You should bring your brother here sometime.

806
48:51.058 --> 48:52.928
I will buy you some delicious meat.

807
48:53.228 --> 48:55.268
Since I received these opening rice cakes.

808
48:55.828 --> 48:56.828
- Okay. - Okay.

809
48:57.268 --> 48:59.468
Silly me. Hurry and sit down, okay?

810
48:59.768 --> 49:01.408
The meat you could not eat the other day,

811
49:01.408 --> 49:02.768
you have to eat it today.

812
49:02.768 --> 49:04.238
- No, it is okay. - No, it is okay.

813
49:04.538 --> 49:06.338
We just came to drop off the rice cakes today.

814
49:06.478 --> 49:07.478
That is right.

815
49:07.538 --> 49:09.108
We wanted to make sure you congratulated us...

816
49:09.178 --> 49:11.118
on our brother becoming an owner.

817
49:12.348 --> 49:14.618
That is exactly why I should treat you to celebrate.

818
49:15.248 --> 49:17.418
Do not refuse and please stay to eat, okay?

819
49:17.488 --> 49:19.088
Sit down.

820
49:19.788 --> 49:20.958
Hurry and sit.

821
49:21.958 --> 49:24.088
I was so grateful to you that day.

822
49:24.188 --> 49:27.128
Here, pick out what you like and put it in here.

823
49:27.728 --> 49:29.328
- Thank you. - Yes.

824
49:29.428 --> 49:30.428
Go ahead.

825
49:41.308 --> 49:43.448
Mom, I...

826
49:44.278 --> 49:46.318
opened a clothing store today.

827
49:47.078 --> 49:48.818
(Mom)

828
49:48.888 --> 49:50.588
(Mom, I opened a clothing store today.)

829
49:56.088 --> 49:57.158
Please congratulate me.

830
49:59.628 --> 50:01.468
Why did you have to live like that?

831
50:02.228 --> 50:03.828
Just because your mom left...

832
50:05.738 --> 50:07.168
and you didn't grow up with her,

833
50:07.238 --> 50:09.438
doesn't mean everyone lives like you.

834
50:18.418 --> 50:19.418
(Unsend)

835
50:22.948 --> 50:24.018
(Unsend)

836
50:24.118 --> 50:25.418
(Would you like to unsend the message?)

837
50:25.488 --> 50:26.488
(This message has been unsent.)

838
50:34.768 --> 50:35.768
(Gyu Oh)

839
50:35.828 --> 50:36.828
(This message has been unsent.)

840
50:43.638 --> 50:44.638
Yes.

841
50:48.678 --> 50:50.848
If that lady knew Gyu Oh was her son,

842
50:50.908 --> 50:53.278
- imagine how happy she would be. - I know.

843
50:53.848 --> 50:55.918
Gyu Oh missed his mom so much.

844
50:58.158 --> 51:01.058
- This is all because of that woman. - Hey.

845
51:03.458 --> 51:04.458
It is delicious.

846
51:07.158 --> 51:09.728
This is nice.

847
51:13.798 --> 51:15.808
Play this just one more time.

848
51:18.178 --> 51:19.338
Are you not open for business?

849
51:19.708 --> 51:23.378
It is fine. Our boss took the day off anyway.

850
51:29.588 --> 51:30.888
Our boss...

851
51:30.948 --> 51:33.758
is so busy raising her kid and dating...

852
51:33.818 --> 51:35.788
that she does not even care about her siblings, right?

853
51:36.088 --> 51:39.758
- Excuse me? - Especially those twin siblings.

854
51:40.228 --> 51:43.198
I heard they have a different mother.

855
51:43.698 --> 51:46.598
I heard she neglects them, mistreats them,

856
51:46.768 --> 51:49.738
and even abuses them. Is that true?

857
51:49.808 --> 51:52.078
No. I have never heard that before.

858
51:52.808 --> 51:55.978
Come on, just tell me the truth.

859
51:57.148 --> 52:01.588
Mr. Song. Please? You have been working here...

860
52:01.648 --> 52:05.018
for eight years now. You live so close...

861
52:05.088 --> 52:06.588
that you are just a stone's throw away,

862
52:06.918 --> 52:08.888
so you must be pretty sharp about their situation, right?

863
52:09.128 --> 52:11.598
No. I am not sharp. I am quite dull.

864
52:12.658 --> 52:15.728
Are you always this obnoxious and dull?

865
52:17.468 --> 52:19.798
Just play this again.

866
52:20.168 --> 52:21.168
Okay.

867
52:31.948 --> 52:35.348
Gyu Rim, you must have seen the news.

868
52:36.388 --> 52:37.548
Where is Mu Jin?

869
52:38.988 --> 52:40.888
He had a complete mental breakdown...

870
52:41.788 --> 52:43.828
and just dropped me off on the street and left.

871
52:45.498 --> 52:46.498
Where did he go?

872
52:49.368 --> 52:50.368
Yong Cheol...

873
52:51.368 --> 52:53.698
was someone Mu Jin really liked and cared for.

874
52:53.768 --> 52:55.168
He was like a younger brother to him.

875
52:55.568 --> 52:57.238
The shock and betrayal must be...

876
53:02.378 --> 53:05.948
But he will probably contact you. He will call you.

877
53:06.048 --> 53:07.318
Do not worry too much.

878
53:08.448 --> 53:10.488
Okay, thank you.

879
53:20.158 --> 53:21.168
Jung Woo.

880
53:25.068 --> 53:26.068
Who was that?

881
53:28.808 --> 53:30.238
I called you, but you did not answer...

882
53:31.938 --> 53:33.678
Was it a blind date?

883
53:34.438 --> 53:35.448
No.

884
53:36.148 --> 53:37.148
Just a neighbour.

885
53:37.878 --> 53:39.278
Did you come because you saw the news too?

886
53:39.948 --> 53:40.948
What news?

887
53:42.048 --> 53:43.048
You did not?

888
53:43.948 --> 53:45.418
Never mind then. You can leave.

889
53:45.888 --> 53:47.458
Jung Woo.

890
53:48.088 --> 53:49.088
Wait.

891
53:49.528 --> 53:52.558
I know you told me not to call, text,

892
53:52.628 --> 53:54.128
or send a message.

893
53:54.358 --> 53:56.628
But you said serious matters and emergencies are an exception.

894
53:57.398 --> 54:00.098
If I do not tell someone, I think I will go crazy.

895
54:02.268 --> 54:05.238
Just this once, can you just be my sounding board?

896
54:06.738 --> 54:07.878
Is it really an emergency?

897
54:26.158 --> 54:27.158
(Mu Jin)

898
54:28.368 --> 54:29.598
The phone is off,

899
54:29.668 --> 54:31.338
so you will be connected to voicemail.

900
54:31.438 --> 54:32.798
Call charges will apply after the tone.

901
54:42.248 --> 54:43.748
So, Gyu Rim's sister,

902
54:43.808 --> 54:46.478
Han Gyu Young's parents-in-law found him and threatened him.

903
54:46.718 --> 54:47.948
Is that what you are saying? The chairman?

904
54:48.018 --> 54:49.018
Yes.

905
54:49.088 --> 54:51.358
My dad pretended to be Han Gyu Young's dad,

906
54:51.418 --> 54:52.958
and even went to the formal meeting of the families.

907
54:53.488 --> 54:55.058
But is he not her dad?

908
54:55.628 --> 54:57.858
Your mom is, anyway, also Han Gyu Young's mom.

909
54:58.428 --> 55:01.128
No, but still, her own father is perfectly alive,

910
55:01.368 --> 55:02.868
and they even live in the same house.

911
55:03.068 --> 55:04.568
How could she pull off such a massive scam?

912
55:05.338 --> 55:07.368
Both Han Gyu Young for asking and my dad for going along with it,

913
55:07.938 --> 55:09.138
they are definitely crazy.

914
55:10.008 --> 55:11.638
Right, that is true.

915
55:12.338 --> 55:15.148
They did give the scammers an excuse.

916
55:15.648 --> 55:17.878
I need to find that girl Han Gyu Young first.

917
55:18.278 --> 55:19.848
I need to find her and confront her.

918
55:23.048 --> 55:27.018
Could you ask Han Gyu Rim for her sister's number?

919
55:28.158 --> 55:30.258
- No. - Why?

920
55:30.458 --> 55:32.128
Even without you adding to it,

921
55:32.198 --> 55:33.598
Gyu Rim is on the verge of losing it right now,

922
55:34.198 --> 55:35.428
so let us not bother Gyu Rim.

923
55:36.468 --> 55:40.068
Who is bothering her? I am just asking you...

924
55:40.138 --> 55:41.738
to get her sister's number.

925
55:47.178 --> 55:49.808
Ma'am, take it easy.

926
55:50.348 --> 55:51.348
Hold on a second.

927
55:57.748 --> 55:58.758
Careful, careful.

928
56:00.418 --> 56:01.958
What brings you all the way here?

929
56:03.658 --> 56:06.228
I was so frustrated,

930
56:06.858 --> 56:09.528
I thought if I stayed like that, I could not even leave a will...

931
56:09.598 --> 56:11.698
and would just die overnight, so I came here.

932
56:12.398 --> 56:14.838
What is the matter?

933
56:15.268 --> 56:16.268
First,

934
56:16.968 --> 56:19.038
could you give me a bowl of cold water?

935
56:19.338 --> 56:21.008
- Yes, right this way. - Okay.

936
56:24.548 --> 56:27.218
I am sorry for interrupting your conversation.

937
56:28.348 --> 56:30.188
The only person I could think of...

938
56:30.488 --> 56:33.158
to open up to was our hometown bachelor here.

939
56:33.788 --> 56:36.288
I will just say my piece quickly and leave,

940
56:36.458 --> 56:37.958
so please wait a little bit.

941
56:38.228 --> 56:41.468
Okay. Jung Woo is very popular.

942
56:41.928 --> 56:43.398
His actual job is a lawyer, too.

943
56:45.168 --> 56:46.168
Is that so?

944
56:48.738 --> 56:51.168
I certainly came to the right place.

945
56:57.778 --> 57:01.448
This is healthy fresh tomato juice. And this is bottled water,

946
57:01.748 --> 57:02.988
so please drink whichever you prefer.

947
57:03.718 --> 57:06.418
You are so sweet.

948
57:06.818 --> 57:11.188
This is why you are the first person I think of, our hometown bachelor.

949
57:12.898 --> 57:14.228
What on earth is going on?

950
57:15.728 --> 57:16.898
You are a lawyer.

951
57:17.928 --> 57:20.338
Then whatever I say from now on,

952
57:20.598 --> 57:24.468
- you will keep it a secret, right? - Of course.

953
57:28.978 --> 57:32.848
But what about her? Should I tell her to go inside?

954
57:33.318 --> 57:34.318
No, no.

955
57:35.488 --> 57:37.248
I already cut in line,

956
57:38.048 --> 57:41.428
and that young lady does not know who I am anyway.

957
57:51.638 --> 57:54.538
There is a sly fox named Han Gyu Young.

958
57:55.508 --> 57:57.668
Did you say Han Gyu Young?

959
57:58.808 --> 58:01.678
She is Gyu Rim's sister.

960
58:03.648 --> 58:05.548
She used to be a doctor...

961
58:05.618 --> 58:07.918
and was the smartest kid in the world,

962
58:09.188 --> 58:11.248
but she suddenly became a complete fool...

963
58:11.318 --> 58:13.188
and is staying at our house right now.

964
58:33.978 --> 58:35.148
Such a sweet scent.

965
58:35.808 --> 58:36.878
I feel alive again.

966
59:32.838 --> 59:34.538
I knew you would be here.

967
59:42.548 --> 59:44.748
(Incoming Call)

968
01:00:04.228 --> 01:00:05.268
Hello?

969
01:00:06.698 --> 01:00:08.138
I did it.

970
01:00:14.638 --> 01:00:15.648
Hey.

971
01:00:16.948 --> 01:00:19.978
I wanted my son...

972
01:00:21.688 --> 01:00:22.688
Mu Jin...

973
01:00:23.488 --> 01:00:25.558
to lose absolutely everything.

974
01:00:25.618 --> 01:00:27.158
So I...

975
01:00:28.118 --> 01:00:30.558
paid those people to do all of it.

976
01:00:32.258 --> 01:00:33.258
Why?

977
01:00:35.268 --> 01:00:36.268
You...

978
01:00:38.568 --> 01:00:42.468
To make you give up on him even one second faster.

979
01:00:46.608 --> 01:00:49.178
If my Mu Jin becomes a beggar...

980
01:00:50.748 --> 01:00:52.718
you will leave him, right?

981
01:00:53.318 --> 01:00:55.648
You will run away without looking back.

982
01:00:55.718 --> 01:00:57.318
Hey, do you think...

983
01:00:58.888 --> 01:01:03.558
I do not know about parasites like you?

984
01:01:33.888 --> 01:01:34.918
Hello.

985
01:01:36.628 --> 01:01:37.628
Gyu Rim.

986
01:01:42.968 --> 01:01:45.098
I have a promise to make to you, Mu Jin.

987
01:01:50.208 --> 01:01:51.738
Even if the world ends,

988
01:01:53.338 --> 01:01:54.838
I will not give up on you.

989
01:01:57.108 --> 01:01:58.148
Never.

990
01:01:59.978 --> 01:02:01.018
Absolutely never.

991
01:02:05.818 --> 01:02:07.418
If you do not mind,

992
01:02:07.988 --> 01:02:10.888
can I give you a bone-crushing hug?

993
01:02:13.758 --> 01:02:15.168
You are suddenly doing something...

994
01:02:26.308 --> 01:02:27.908
Tell me if you do not like it.

995
01:02:29.278 --> 01:02:31.308
I will not take responsibility if your bones break.

996
01:03:41.118 --> 01:03:43.048
(Love on the Menu)

997
01:03:43.318 --> 01:03:44.518
Let us get married, Gyu Oh.

998
01:03:44.588 --> 01:03:46.388
That is the Han Gyu Oh you have been searching for, right, Mom?

999
01:03:46.458 --> 01:03:47.558
Han Gyu Oh.

1000
01:03:47.618 --> 01:03:51.928
- He is Kwon Hee Na's boyfriend. - Gyu Young is really okay, right?

1001
01:03:51.998 --> 01:03:53.158
Do you want to get beaten up or just leave?

1002
01:03:53.228 --> 01:03:54.598
- Who are you? - You punk!

1003
01:03:54.598 --> 01:03:55.728
Han Gyu Young!

1004
01:03:55.728 --> 01:03:58.398
Do you think I do not know about parasites like you?

1005
01:03:59.038 --> 01:04:00.368
Could you just get lost?

1006
01:04:00.798 --> 01:04:01.868
What is all this?

1007
01:04:01.938 --> 01:04:04.468
Before you get even more ruined, let us stop here.

1008
01:04:04.768 --> 01:04:07.838
Let us not lose, Mu Jin. You can do it, Kim Mu Jin.
